  "card": {
    "closed": false,
    "dateLastActivity": "2026-11-24T16:18:58.787Z",
    "desc": "# Lore:\n\n# **“I… have the ability to catch the rainbow.”**\n\n**The stand of Blackmore. A mask-like Stand that grants the user the ability to manipulate rain. He can freeze raindrops in mid-air to walk upon them or use them as deadly, razor-sharp projectiles.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53affbd60b971ee2d437a/previews/6ab53b00bd60b971ee2d43ca/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa13043db5ac2cc4ce539d/previews/6afa13043db5ac2cc4ce645f/download/image.webp)\n\n---\n\n## Catch The Rainbow\n\n**Catch The Rainbow needs fog, rain, or an active hydrant within 30 studs to be used.**\n\n## Rain Walking/Floating\n\n**Summon your stand, then hold Space for a short moment to begin rising. Release Jump to keep your height and move horizontally. Hold Z to descend. Sprinting makes horizontal floating faster. Landing ends the float; release and press Jump again after a dive.**\n\n![float.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53ac85ac7748c10321282/previews/6ab53acd5ac7748c1032138d/download/float.gif)\n\n## Hidden Controls\n\n**While floating, E activates Rain Transport. While hidden, aim at an enemy and press M1 for its teleport follow-up. With the mask on, Ctrl launches Body Projectile. Both extra moves are listed in Moves.**\n\n## Rain Transport\n\n![ctr.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53b902d43581bd4567a85/previews/6ab53b952d43581bd4567e6f/download/ctr.gif)\n\n## Followup\n\n![reappear.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53c55c793fb9fbd4420e3/previews/6ab53c5ac793fb9fbd4423a2/download/reappear.gif)\n\n## Body Projectile\n\n**Detach your  arm and steer it with the camera to grab an enemy.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n![ctrl.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53ce42b05ceab3a57cbfa/previews/6ab53ce92b05ceab3a57cde9/download/ctrl.gif)\n\n# Weapons Of Rain\n\n**Fire seven water shots that soak enemies on impact.**\n\n**Aim at your target before casting. The rain bursts also apply water to fire and gasoline they hit**.\n\n**Base cooldown: 23s**\n\n![raindropfix.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53f0118103f44f7bcbfe3/previews/6ab53f0518103f44f7bccae6/download/raindropfix.gif)\n\n## Motionless Rain\n\n**Surround yourself with suspended raindrops for projectile defense.**\n\n**Your mask must be on. The raindrops stay around you until  used up; wait for them to clear before creating another set.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 45s**\n\n![raindrooops.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab43547aecedbc970a3af11/attachments/6ab53e5b558de78af70ca5f2/previews/6ab53e5e558de78af70ca8eb/download/raindrooops.gif)\n\n## Triple Shot\n\n**Fire three shots toward your mouse.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 27s**\n\n![tripleshot.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa137050ec549284a9fb5d/previews/6afa137350ec549284a9fdd4/download/tripleshot.gif)\n\n## Rain Catch\n\n**Leap up and press again in the air to dive, or dive at once while airborne, catching an enemy through ordinary guard and executing a weakened target.**\n\n**Can be perfect blocked.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 32s**\n\n## First use:\n\n![jump.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa13d84a817da0ec94cc22/previews/6afa13db4a817da0ec94d00d/download/jump.gif)\n\n## In air:\n\n![catch.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa1416ad6ccd825c589df4/previews/6afa141aad6ccd825c58a38f/download/catch.gif)\n\n---\n\n# EX Moves [Awakening Moves]\n\n## Frozen Rain [2 Bars]\n\n**Form a frozen dagger for 20 seconds, replacing your light and heavy attacks with bleeding slashes that can sever a limb.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 35s**\n\n![freeze.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa14d264e92fab3ad6ee94/previews/6afa14d464e92fab3ad6f133/download/freeze.gif)\n\n## M1s:\n\n![m1s.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa15104b31676ce17b23ce/previews/6afa15144b31676ce17b2a61/download/m1s.gif)\n\n## M2:\n\n![m2s.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6afa152045e48d297a9e4358/previews/6afa152245e48d297a9e457d/download/m2s.gif)\n\n## Generic Unbranded Ocarina (5 Bars)\n\n**Play Rhapsody of Rain on your ocarina to call 30 seconds of rain. Play low D, F and high D twice. Completing the song spends five EX bars. You can play it with the mask off.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 90s**\n\n![ocarina.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6af25325efcf475a0337cdc6/attachments/6b05b8ea65aecfdbb79619fb/previews/6b05b8f065aecfdbb79621a4/download/ocarina.gif)",
